msgstr "Kanaalmischer..."

#: imageplugins/channelmixer/channelmixertool.cpp:196
#: imageplugins/channelmixer/channelmixertool.cpp:524
msgid "Channel Mixer"
msgstr "Kanaal-Mischer"

#: imageplugins/channelmixer/channelmixertool.cpp:204
msgid ""
"You can see here the image's color channels' gain adjustments preview. You "
"can pick a color on the image to see the corresponding color level on the "
"histogram."
msgstr ""
"Dit is de Vöransicht för de Verstärken vun dat Bild sien Klöörkanaals. Du "
"kannst en Klöör ut dat Bild utsöken un Di de tohören Klöörstoop in't "
"Histogramm ankieken."

#: imageplugins/channelmixer/channelmixertool.cpp:225
msgid "Red:"
msgstr "Root:"

#: imageplugins/channelmixer/channelmixertool.cpp:230
msgid "Select the red color gain, as a percentage, for the current channel."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du de rode Klöörverstärken för den aktuellen Kanaal in Perzent "
