#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:96
msgid ""
"<p>digiKam attempts to support all of the image formats that digital cameras "
"produce, while being able to handle a few other important video and audio "
"formats.</p> <p>You can add to the already-appreciable list of formats that "
"digiKam handles by adding the extension of the type you want to add. "
"Multiple extensions need to be separated by a space.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>DigiKam versöcht, dat all Bildformaten ünnerstütt warrt, de de "
"Digitaalkameras bruken doot, un dor blang noch en Reeg anner wichtig Video- "
"und Klangdatei-Formaten.</p> <p>Du kannst de List mit Dateiformaten, mit de "
"digiKam wat anfangen kann un de al recht groot is, wat tofögen, wenn Du de "
"Verwiedern för den Dateityp angiffst. Mehr as een Verweidern laat sik mit "
"Freetekens dor twüschen ingeven.</p>"

#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:111
msgid ""
"Additional &image file extensions (<a href='image'>Currently-supported "
"types</a>):"
msgstr ""
"Bilddatei-Verwiedern bito (<a href='image'>Opstunns ünnerstütt Typen</a>):"

#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:115
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can add the extensions of image files (including RAW files) to "
"be displayed in the Album view. Just put \"xyz abc\" to display files with "
"the xyz and abc extensions in your Album view.</p><p>You can also remove "
"file formats that are shown by default by putting a minus sign in front of "
"the extension: e.g. \"-gif\" would remove all GIF files from your Album view "
"and any trace of them in your database. They would not be deleted, just not "
"shown in digiKam.</p><p><b>Warning:</b> Removing files from the database "
"means losing all of their tags and ratings.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du de Albenansicht mehr Bilddatei-Verwiedern (ok Rohdateien) "
"tofögen. Giff eenfach \"xyz abc\" in, wenn Du Dateien mit de Ennen *.xyz un "
"*.abc bruken wullt.</p><p>Ok standardwies ünnerstütt Dateien laat sik mit en "
"vöransett Minus-Teken ut de List wegdoon: \"-gif\" deit a.B. all GIF-Dateien "
"ut de Datenbank weg, man nich vun de Fastplaat.</p><p><b>Wohrschoen:</b> "
"Wenn Dateien ut de Datenbank wegdaan warrt, kaamt ok all ehr Slötelwöör un "
"Beweerten weg!</p>"

#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:129 utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:167
#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:205
msgid "Revert to default settings"
msgstr "Op Vörinstellen torüchsetten"

#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:147
msgid ""
"Additional &movie file extensions (<a href='video'>Currently-supported "
"types</a>):"
msgstr ""
"&Filmdatei-Verwiedern bito (<a href='video'>Opstunns ünnerstütt Typen</a>):"

#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:151
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can add extra extensions of video files to be displayed in your "
"Album view. Just write \"xyz abc\" to support files with the *.xyz and *.abc "
"extensions. Clicking on these files will play them in an embedded KDE movie "
"player.</p><p>You can also remove file formats that are supported by default "
"by putting a minus sign in front of the extension: e.g. \"-avi\" would "
"remove all AVI files from your Album view and any trace of them in your "
"database. They would not be deleted, just not shown in digiKam.</"
"p><p><b>Warning:</b> Removing files from the database means losing all of "
"their tags and ratings.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du de Albenansicht mehr Videodatei-Verwiedern tofögen. Giff "
"eenfach \"xyz abc\" in, wenn Du Dateien mit de Ennen *.xyz un *.abc bruken "
"wullt. Wenn Du disse Dateien anklickst, speelt en inbett KDE-Videoafspeler "
"ehr af.</p><p>Ok standardwies ünnerstütt Dateiformaten laat sik mit en "
"vöransett Minus-Teken ut de List wegdoon: \"-avi\" deit a.B. all AVI-Dateien "
"ut de Datenbank weg, man nich vun de Fastplaat.</p><p><b>Wohrschoen:</b> "
"Wenn Dateien ut de Datenbank wegdaan warrt, kaamt ok all ehr Slötelwöör un "
"Beweerten weg!</p>"

#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:185
msgid ""
"Additional &audio file extensions (<a href='audio'>Currently-supported "
"types</a>):"
msgstr ""
"&Klangdatei-Verwiedern bito (<a href='audio'>Opstunns ünnerstütt Typen</a>):"

#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:189
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can add extra extensions of audio files to be displayed in your "
"Album view. Just write \"mp7\" to support files with the *.mp7 extension. "
"Clicking on these files will play them in an embedded KDE audio player.</"
"p><p>You can also remove file formats that are supported by default by "
"putting a minus sign in front of the extension: e.g. \"-ogg\" would remove "
"all OGG files from your Album view and any trace of them in your database. "
"They would not be deleted, just not shown in digiKam.</p><p><b>Warning:</b> "
"Removing files from the database means losing all of their tags and ratings."
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du de Albenansicht mehr Klangdatei-Verwiedern tofögen. Giff "
"eenfach \"mp7\" in, wenn Du Dateien mit de Ennen *.mp7 bruken wullt. En "
"Klick op disse Dateien speelt se denn mit en inbett KDE-Klangafspeler af.</"
"p><p>Ok standardwies ünnerstütt Dateien laat sik mit en vöransett Minus-"
"Teken ut de List wegdoon: \"-ogg\" deit a.B. all OGG-Dateien ut de Datenbank "
"weg, man nich vun de Fastplaat.</p><p><b>Wohrschoen:</b> Wenn Dateien ut de "
"Datenbank wegdaan warrt, kaamt ok all ehr Slötelwöör un Beweerten weg!</p>"

#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:279
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>You have chosen to remove the following image formats from the list of "
"supported formats: <b>%1</b>.</p><p>These are very common formats. If you "
"have images in your collection with these formats, they will be removed from "
"the database and you will lose all information about them, including rating "
"and tags.</p><p>Are you sure you want to apply your changes and lose the "
"support for these formats?</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du wullt de nakamen Bildformaten ut de List vun ünnerstütt Formaten "
"wegdoon: <b>%1</b>.</p><p>Disse Formaten sünd bannig begäng. Wenn Dien "
"Sammeln Biller mit disse Formaten bargt, warrt se tosamen mit all ehr "
"Informatschonen ut de Datenbank wegdaan. Ok ehr Beweerten un Slötelwöör "
"kaamt weg.</p><p> Wullt Du Dien Ännern för ünnerstütt Dateiformaten redig "
"bruken?</p>"

#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:325
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Files with these extensions will be recognized as images and included "
"into the database:<br/> <code>%1</code></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Dateien mit disse Verwiedern warrt as Biller kennt un na de Datenbank "
"opnahmen:<br/> <code>%1</code></p>"

#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:335
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Files with these extensions will be recognized as movie files and "
"included into the database:<br/> <code>%1</code></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Dateien mit disse Verwiedern warrt as Videodateien kennt un na de "
"Datenbank opnahmen:<br/> <code>%1</code></p>"

#: utilities/setup/setupmime.cpp:345
#, kde-format
